OL,3,AItalian chef fired after refusing to
OL,4,Aput pineapple on pizza
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Italian chef sacked from a Brisbane
OL,7,Frestaurant had refused to put pineapple
OL,8,Fon a pizza because it was an "insult to
OL,9,Fhis culture".
OL,11,FDavide Tamburella was fired from the
OL,12,Fnow-closed La Costa restaurant in May,
OL,13,Fa fortnight after a meeting with
OL,14,Fmanagement who had a string of
OL,15,Fcomplaints about the chef's behaviour.
OL,17,FAmong them were Tamburella's refusal to
OL,18,Fprovide ham and pineapple pizza for
OL,19,Fguests at a function. At the time, the
OL,20,Fchef had stated that any direction from
OL,21,Fmanagement "need not be followed when
OL,22,Fit is offensive to his culture".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
